        return credited - SPECIAL_CARD_SURCHARGE;
    }
}

A customer pays with a special card and inserts 8.00. Work through both methods: what value is finally credited toward the purchase?,8.00 - the surcharge is charged separately to the customer's bank,"7.75 - super.process(8.00) passes the minimum check and returns 8.00, then the 0.25 surcharge is subtracted",8.25 - the surcharge is added to the amount tendered,5.00 - the amount is capped at the card minimum,,2,"The subclass runs the parent's rule first, then applies its own adjustment to the parent's result. That ordering is what makes the two rules compose instead of conflict.",1

